{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Have you ever wondered what people dream about?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a doctor and scientist running your own clinic, treating patients with sleep disorders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into their minds and traverse nightmare worlds inspired by dark medieval fantasy, where each dream presents a unique challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your clinic and treatments, uncover the secrets of your patients\u2026 and unravel the plot of the rival clinic and the mysterious disappearance of your father.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/8f93131eaf82285e8c42f28cd883f7e1.avif?t=1764939053\" width=600 height=150 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/2d1096077f49bfca16196153562334a6.poster.avif?t=1764939053\" width=780 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/2d1096077f49bfca16196153562334a6.webm?t=1764939053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/2d1096077f49bfca16196153562334a6.mp4?t=1764939053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore unique dreams divided into 5 chapters, each with completely different mechanics: from boss fights and puzzle solving to stealth sequences and psychological horror.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/cf19585a7ec53d0a25dd7a088e66f136.avif?t=1764939053\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/1e165657ba31e684681edfb301d520a2.poster.avif?t=1764939053\" width=780 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/1e165657ba31e684681edfb301d520a2.webm?t=1764939053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/1e165657ba31e684681edfb301d520a2.mp4?t=1764939053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create personalized medicine to deliver to your customers or patients. Combine unique ingredients, follow secret recipes, and experiment to discover new effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/9118b0ad58572b4c3084fe2f793f1918.avif?t=1764939053\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/bf6a6228ea121bdfee4e9090fda4ac80.poster.avif?t=1764939053\" width=780 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/bf6a6228ea121bdfee4e9090fda4ac80.webm?t=1764939053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/bf6a6228ea121bdfee4e9090fda4ac80.mp4?t=1764939053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Receive patients, clean rooms, hire staff, upgrade facilities, and earn reputation\u2026 or end up bankrupt due to malpractice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/196018a2e4722fc1d4a22f08c8ee6f98.avif?t=1764939053\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/26682862c42f5a844a0a3d25184e5142.poster.avif?t=1764939053\" width=780 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/26682862c42f5a844a0a3d25184e5142.webm?t=1764939053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/26682862c42f5a844a0a3d25184e5142.mp4?t=1764939053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rival clinic hides something on the third floor. If you decide to infiltrate it, you must move stealthily, avoid cameras, and outsmart an advanced AI that learns your movements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3775270?t=1764939053","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/9f0c1411da240d4f4db0d2afa4bfc2ca851e074b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764939053","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/6f45be4a360f4a2f59643dee0ab684287e323599/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764939053","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/6f45be4a360f4a2f59643dee0ab684287e323599/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764939053","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3900630,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Have you ever wondered what people dream about?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a doctor and scientist running your own clinic, treating patients with sleep disorders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into their minds and traverse nightmare worlds inspired by dark medieval fantasy, where each dream presents a unique challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your clinic and treatments, uncover the secrets of your patients\u2026 and unravel the plot of the rival clinic and the mysterious disappearance of your father.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/8f93131eaf82285e8c42f28cd883f7e1.avif?t=1764939053\" width=600 height=150 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/2d1096077f49bfca16196153562334a6.poster.avif?t=1764939053\" width=780 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/2d1096077f49bfca16196153562334a6.webm?t=1764939053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/2d1096077f49bfca16196153562334a6.mp4?t=1764939053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore unique dreams divided into 5 chapters, each with completely different mechanics: from boss fights and puzzle solving to stealth sequences and psychological horror.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/cf19585a7ec53d0a25dd7a088e66f136.avif?t=1764939053\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=