6018a2e4722fc1d4a22f08c8ee6f98.avif?t=1764939053\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/26682862c42f5a844a0a3d25184e5142.poster.avif?t=1764939053\" width=780 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/26682862c42f5a844a0a3d25184e5142.webm?t=1764939053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/26682862c42f5a844a0a3d25184e5142.mp4?t=1764939053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rival clinic hides something on the third floor. If you decide to infiltrate it, you must move stealthily, avoid cameras, and outsmart an advanced AI that learns your movements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Papu's Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/8f0aa8c925b306adbafaa40ab19aff50f0fc44db/header.jpg?t=1764939053","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"<strong>\u00a9 2025 Papu's Studio. All rights reserved.  </strong><br>Doctor Dreams Simulator was independently developed.  <br>All visual, audio, and gameplay elements are the property of the creator,  <br>except for third-party resources, which are credited accordingly.  <br>Redistribution, modification, or commercial use without permission is prohibited.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3775270/2023287095/938d78e66dabb39425905c5ac3a5b0581906555d/1750372449/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764938314",